   127	## 2. THEOREM T1 — `O2` solves exactly; the divisibility `eta | sG`
   128	
   129	The spec factors `O2` only after setting `G=0` (`spec:192-205`). Carrying `G`
   130	through gives a closed form on the whole live section.
   131	
   132	**Step 1 (the `G`-free part).** With `C1 = d h`, `h0 := psi s`, `e0 := Z eta^2`,
   133	direct collection reproduces the spec's factorization
   134	
