   400	
   401	**Per cell: yes, grossly overdetermined.** With `a = b = eta_e = 1` the cell
   402	`(e,U)` has
   403	
   404	```text
   405	  unknowns  =  e + (sigma+1) + (m+1) + (n+1) + 2e + (sigma+e+1) + 3n/2 + 2
   406	  equations =  (U+2e) + (U+2e+1) + (3e+U+2) + (2U+e) + (sigma+e+1) + (2U-e)
   407	```
   408	
   409	from `EQ1, EQ2, EQ3, EQ4`, `T1` and `E0` respectively (the `+2` is `kappa` and
   410	the saturation variable). Measured sizes:
   411	
   412	```text
   413	   (e,U)   g  sigma  m   n    unknowns  equations  excess
   414	   (1, 3)  2    2    3   2       22        37        15
   415	   (1, 5)  2    3    5   4       31        52        21
